## [OBJECTIVE]

Run the `zg` CLI to build, refresh, or inspect the zvec-grep index for the current workspace. zg is installed globally via npm (`@zvec/zvec-grep`). The MCP tool `zvec_grep_search` only searches — index lifecycle lives here.

## [ARGUMENT_PARSING]

`$ARGUMENTS` is whitespace-separated tokens:

| Token     | Action                                        |
|-----------|-----------------------------------------------|
| `force`   | `zg index --rebuild` (full rebuild)           |
| `drop`    | `zg index --drop --yes` (remove the index)    |
| `status`  | `zg status` (inspect only, no changes)        |
| *(none)*  | `zg index` (create or incremental update)     |

Unknown tokens: ignore them. Empty `$ARGUMENTS` is the common case — plain incremental index.

